				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nahyesq" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5128230); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5128230&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609509813" alt="nahyesq" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5128230)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nahyesq" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5128230); return false;" >nahyesq</a></span> <span class="odate time_1609508434 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">01 Jan 2021 13:40</span>
																	<br/>
						in discussion <a href="/forum/c-89000/help:ideas-critique">Writing Help / Help: Ideas Critique</a> &raquo;
						<a href="/forum/t-13960067/a-thousand-door-seeking-greenlight">A Thousand Door (Seeking Greenlight)</a>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4859377">
									

<p>Thank you for the quick look! sorry for the late response, got a lot of things going on around.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;More&nbsp;elaborate&nbsp;explanation</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Here&nbsp;it&nbsp;goes</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p>What is anomalous about that?</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The room itself had its potential danger the deeper it goes, an entity from the colonial era that may or may not be hostile towards any individual that is in the area. The room also may contain cognitive-based hazard that will cause hallucination or even audio disturbances, it tries to repel any foreign individual that is not part of the room with it. I planned to make it seemed like that &quot;Backrooms&quot; kind of vibe towards the rooms that are about to be explored.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>where is the narrative.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The Narrative will be focused on the exploration log. As I said earlier, the deeper it goes, the darker of the story we're being told towards the truth about what happened.</p>
<p>Now, what is the truth?</p>
<p>This building is a place where Tourists could see the great colonialism, how they managed to steer and changed the way this country look. The deeper as it goes, the more we know about that this colonialism is not humane, full of discriminatory and were built based on misery of the thousand people without being known by the public. The Underground represents the dark side of the events while the upper grounds represents on the sweet fruity results of the colonialism.</p>
<p>A lot of people died, being tortured, slaved, being forced to work for a whole full day without being paid, etc. Just for the sake of &quot;The Great Colonialism Movement&quot; made by the dutch colonies back then. This makes, let's just say, Ghosts from the past still lingering around inside the underground base, because they were shutted down deep down to not let anyone knew what exactly just happened at that time.</p>
<p>This motivates that The Foundation should keep an eye and prevent entities to go through the uppergrounds section, especially the hostile ones, to prevent damages that were caused by those entities towards the public. Because some of the times an entity, lets just say XXXX-1, may come up to the upper grounds that some of the night guards are bothered by their existence and some of them also causes some damage towards the property or even the guards itself.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>I'll try to answer this questions regarding the vague-ness or more elaboration on what i meant about this/that towards my explanation.</p>
<p>Thanks in advance! I'll look forward for more critiques.</p>

							</div>

